text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 生息之力•滋养.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/7d/grwnz8fin8ypnpskba01pgrleks1pa7.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%94%9F%E6%81%AF%E4%B9%8B%E5%8A%9B%E2%80%A2%E6%BB%8B%E5%85%BB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/7d/grwnz8fin8ypnpskba01pgrleks1pa7.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%94%9F%E6%81%AF%E4%B9%8B%E5%8A%9B%E2%80%A2%E6%BB%8B%E5%85%BB.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/7d/grwnz8fin8ypnpskba01pgrleks1pa7.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />生息之力•滋养\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-5\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓8-↑8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（治疗）单体治疗，治疗量为施法者<font color=\"#58cb48\">80%</font>魔攻值，并使目标获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲魔防2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲魔防2</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>回合；若目标是召唤角色[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"植物朋友\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">植物朋友</font></span></span>]，则使其变为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"夏铃草\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">夏铃草</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-5 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/99/at4dr45s2ma4cti9dv4gkekpa78egvl.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-5_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/99/at4dr45s2ma4cti9dv4gkekpa78egvl.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%8A%99%E6%8B%89%E7%BB%B4%E5%A8%85\" title=\"角色图鉴库/芙拉维娅\"><img alt=\"头像 芙拉维娅.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/1b/gkn483al8ue62m8a4du2ixq3ousmg1k.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">芙拉维娅</font></div>\n</div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left; width:320px;\"><div